{"id":"cf240c9e497736f5","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-vector-measure.md","title":"Vector Measure","display":"df-vector-measure — Vector Measure","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-vector-measure","aliases":["58-df-vector-measure","Vector Measure"],"display":"df-vector-measure — Vector Measure","depends_on":["[[58-df-banach-space]]","[[58-df-sigma-algebra]]","[[58-df-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-vector-measure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-vector-measure</span><span>Vector Measure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-vector-measure — Vector Measure"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ef59807ad934771f\" href=\"?note=ef59807ad934771f\" title=\"58-df-banach-space\">58-df-banach-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a740bdad87b97ac6\" href=\"?note=a740bdad87b97ac6\" title=\"58-df-sigma-algebra\">58-df-sigma-algebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Explicit relation signatures used below: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Banach}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{Banach}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Function}\\subseteq V^{3}\">\\(\\operatorname{Function}\\subseteq V^{3}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{VectorMeasureStructure}_S\\subseteq V^8\">\\(\\mathrm{VectorMeasureStructure}_S\\subseteq V^8\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{VectorMeasure}_S\\subseteq V^5\\cup V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{VectorMeasure}_S\\subseteq V^5\\cup V^3\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\mathcal F,H,K,+_H,\\odot_H,m,\\|\\cdot\\|_H\\in V\">\\(X,\\mathcal F,H,K,+_H,\\odot_H,m,\\|\\cdot\\|_H\\in V\\)</span> (measurable space, fully structured Banach range and set function)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Banach}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Banach}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}\">\\(\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (upstream predicates)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{VectorMeasureStructure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{VectorMeasureStructure}_S\\)</span> (fully explicit predicate) and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{VectorMeasure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{VectorMeasure}_S\\)</span> (compatibility projections defined here)</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}vector\\text{-}measure\\text{-}explicit}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{VectorMeasureStructure}_S(m,X,\\mathcal F,H,K,+_H,\\odot_H,\\|\\cdot\\|_H)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Banach}_S(H,K,+_H,\\odot_H,\\|\\cdot\\|_H)\\land\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal F,X)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(m,\\mathcal F,H)\\land\\exists0_H\\in H\\;\\Bigl(\\forall h\\in H\\;(0_H+_Hh=h)\\land m(\\varnothing)=0_H\\land\n\\forall E\\in\\mathcal F^\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\\forall i,j\\in\\omega\\;(i\\neq j\\to E_i\\cap E_j=\\varnothing)\\to\n\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\n\\bigl(N\\leq n\\to\\|m(\\bigcup_{i\\in\\omega}E_i)+_H((-1_K)\\odot_H\\sum_{i&lt;n}m(E_i))\\|_H&lt;\\varepsilon\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}vector\\text{-}measure\\text{-}explicit}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{VectorMeasureStructure}_S(m,X,\\mathcal F,H,K,+_H,\\odot_H,\\|\\cdot\\|_H)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Banach}_S(H,K,+_H,\\odot_H,\\|\\cdot\\|_H)\\land\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal F,X)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(m,\\mathcal F,H)\\land\\exists0_H\\in H\\;\\Bigl(\\forall h\\in H\\;(0_H+_Hh=h)\\land m(\\varnothing)=0_H\\land\n\\forall E\\in\\mathcal F^\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\\forall i,j\\in\\omega\\;(i\\neq j\\to E_i\\cap E_j=\\varnothing)\\to\n\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\n\\bigl(N\\leq n\\to\\|m(\\bigcup_{i\\in\\omega}E_i)+_H((-1_K)\\odot_H\\sum_{i&lt;n}m(E_i))\\|_H&lt;\\varepsilon\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}vector\\text{-}measure\\text{-}explicit}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{VectorMeasure}_S(m,X,\\mathcal F,H,\\|\\cdot\\|_H)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists K,+_H,\\odot_H\\in V\\;\\mathrm{VectorMeasureStructure}_S(m,X,\\mathcal F,H,K,+_H,\\odot_H,\\|\\cdot\\|_H)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}vector\\text{-}measure\\text{-}explicit}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{VectorMeasure}_S(m,X,\\mathcal F,H,\\|\\cdot\\|_H)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists K,+_H,\\odot_H\\in V\\;\\mathrm{VectorMeasureStructure}_S(m,X,\\mathcal F,H,K,+_H,\\odot_H,\\|\\cdot\\|_H)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}vector\\text{-}measure\\text{-}alias}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{VectorMeasure}_S(m,\\mathcal F,H)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists X,\\|\\cdot\\|_H\\in V\\;\\mathrm{VectorMeasure}_S(m,X,\\mathcal F,H,\\|\\cdot\\|_H)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}vector\\text{-}measure\\text{-}alias}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{VectorMeasure}_S(m,\\mathcal F,H)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists X,\\|\\cdot\\|_H\\in V\\;\\mathrm{VectorMeasure}_S(m,X,\\mathcal F,H,\\|\\cdot\\|_H)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The canonical structure predicate binds the Banach addition, scalar action, and additive zero used by countable additivity; the five- and three-place forms are existential projections.</li>\n<li>Semivariation is obtained by taking the supremum of the total variations of scalarizations <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x^*\\circ m\">\\(x^*\\circ m\\)</span> over the dual unit ball; it is a downstream construction.</li>\n<li>A Bochner-valued Radon–Nikodym theorem requires an appropriate Radon–Nikodym property of the range space; it is not part of the vector-measure definition.</li>\n<li>Lyapunov convexity holds for finite-dimensional nonatomic vector measures; it can fail in infinite-dimensional Banach spaces.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Diestel and Uhl, Vector Measures</li>\n<li>Wu and Chen, Vector Valued Measures and Convergence</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-banach-space","status":"resolved","id":"ef59807ad934771f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-banach-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-sigma-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"a740bdad87b97ac6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-sigma-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Banach}_S\\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Function}\\subseteq V^{3}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{VectorMeasureStructure}_S\\subseteq V^8","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{VectorMeasure}_S\\subseteq V^5\\cup V^3","display":false},{"tex":"X,\\mathcal F,H,K,+_H,\\odot_H,m,\\|\\cdot\\|_H\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Banach}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{VectorMeasureStructure}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{VectorMeasure}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}vector\\text{-}measure\\text{-}explicit}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{VectorMeasureStructure}_S(m,X,\\mathcal F,H,K,+_H,\\odot_H,\\|\\cdot\\|_H)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Banach}_S(H,K,+_H,\\odot_H,\\|\\cdot\\|_H)\\land\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal F,X)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(m,\\mathcal F,H)\\land\\exists0_H\\in H\\;\\Bigl(\\forall h\\in H\\;(0_H+_Hh=h)\\land m(\\varnothing)=0_H\\land\n\\forall E\\in\\mathcal F^\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\\forall i,j\\in\\omega\\;(i\\neq j\\to E_i\\cap E_j=\\varnothing)\\to\n\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\n\\bigl(N\\leq n\\to\\|m(\\bigcup_{i\\in\\omega}E_i)+_H((-1_K)\\odot_H\\sum_{i<n}m(E_i))\\|_H<\\varepsilon\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}vector\\text{-}measure\\text{-}explicit}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{VectorMeasure}_S(m,X,\\mathcal F,H,\\|\\cdot\\|_H)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists K,+_H,\\odot_H\\in V\\;\\mathrm{VectorMeasureStructure}_S(m,X,\\mathcal F,H,K,+_H,\\odot_H,\\|\\cdot\\|_H)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}vector\\text{-}measure\\text{-}alias}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{VectorMeasure}_S(m,\\mathcal F,H)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists X,\\|\\cdot\\|_H\\in V\\;\\mathrm{VectorMeasure}_S(m,X,\\mathcal F,H,\\|\\cdot\\|_H)","display":true},{"tex":"x^*\\circ m","display":false}],"bytes":2833,"backlinks":[{"id":"958a2e76ad885c1e","anchor":"ref-2",